#: ../../source/query-string_readme.md:59
msgid ""
"Parse a query string into an object. Leading `?` or `#` are ignored, so "
"you can pass `location.search` or `location.hash` directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/query-string_readme.md:61
msgid ""
"The returned object is created with "
"[`Object.create(null)`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object/create) and thus "
"does not have a `prototype`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/query-string_readme.md:63
msgid ""
"URI components are decoded with [`decode-uri-"
"component`](https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component)."
msgstr ""

